# POSortedJE.sortspec — Sort specification for PO commitment SJE output (Sub-Task 1)
#
# PO commitment events are sorted by instrument ID (VENDORID) first, then by
# fiscal period and transaction date.  This key aligns PO rows with the
# SortedJE.sortspec payment key so that Sub-Task 2 can merge both streams by
# instrument in a single k-way merge pass.
#
# DFSORT equivalent:
#   SORT FIELDS=(transIPID,transFiscalPeriod,transTransDate),FORMAT=CH,ORDER=A
#
# field_name,                     col_index, type, order
transIPID,                         0,        CH,   A
transFiscalPeriod,                22,        CH,   A
transTransDate,                   24,        CH,   A
